{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object present, pick it up, move to destination, then perform task. Else, scan area or wander around.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectPresent    /> <Sequence> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = WanderAround    /> </Sequence> <Condition ID = IsAreaClear    />",
